                      (    forth6809.asm):01662         ; positive/negative/zero cases per word - not an exhaustive sign
                      (    forth6809.asm):01663         ; combination sweep, but enough to exercise each word's actual
                      (    forth6809.asm):01664         ; branches (sign handling, division's throw-on-zero, multiply's
                      (    forth6809.asm):01665         ; defined-truncation-not-error overflow behavior). See the
                      (    forth6809.asm):01666         ; open-items checklist for the full reasoning behind the specific
                      (    forth6809.asm):01667         ; cases chosen.
                      (    forth6809.asm):01668         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
