                      (    forth6809.asm):02944         ; TSTDARITH - mixed & double-precision arithmetic tests (glossary
                      (    forth6809.asm):02945         ; section 3.5). Covers every word in that section. All 14 words
                      (    forth6809.asm):02946         ; traced by hand against their real implementations before any
                      (    forth6809.asm):02947         ; test was written - push/pop order for double-cell values (low
                      (    forth6809.asm):02948         ; cell pushed first, high cell last/on top - confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):02949         ; across every word here), and which of two operands is which
                      (    forth6809.asm):02950         ; (d1 vs d2, dividend vs divisor) - not assumed from the glossary
                      (    forth6809.asm):02951         ; stack-effect notation alone. FM/MOD (floored) and SM/REM
                      (    forth6809.asm):02952         ; (symmetric) tested against the same negative-dividend case
                      (    forth6809.asm):02953         ; specifically because that's where the two conventions actually
                      (    forth6809.asm):02954         ; diverge - confirmed distinct expected results for each.
                      (    forth6809.asm):02955         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
