                      (    forth6809.asm):05263                                   ; COLON (sets STATE=-1) and SEMI (sets
                      (    forth6809.asm):05264                                   ; STATE=0, after checking CSP) are the
                      (    forth6809.asm):05265                                   ; correct, sole places STATE should change
                      (    forth6809.asm):05266                                   ; during normal operation - the old QLOOP
                      (    forth6809.asm):05267                                   ; reset was a third, redundant one that
                      (    forth6809.asm):05268                                   ; silently dropped back to interpret mode
                      (    forth6809.asm):05269                                   ; every time QUERY read a new line,
                      (    forth6809.asm):05270                                   ; regardless of whether ";" had actually
                      (    forth6809.asm):05271                                   ; been reached. A colon definition split
                      (    forth6809.asm):05272                                   ; across multiple lines would have every
