                      (    forth6809.asm):06821                                   ; past. Re-traced by counting every real
                      (    forth6809.asm):06822                                   ; push/pop across a nested DO: after the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06823                                   ; inner DOSETUP finishes, S is [inner-index@0]
