                      (    forth6809.asm):08187                                  ; leave set, not the sign of the value just
                      (    forth6809.asm):08188                                  ; popped. TSTA explicitly tests D's high byte
                      (    forth6809.asm):08189                                  ; (bit 7 of A reflects the full 16-bit value's
                      (    forth6809.asm):08190                                  ; sign) immediately before the branch that
