                      (    forth6809.asm):09809         ;
                      (    forth6809.asm):09810         ; WORDLISTS (16.3.2, Search-Order word set) is deliberately absent
                      (    forth6809.asm):09811         ; from ENVTABLE, not an oversight - this system doesn't implement
                      (    forth6809.asm):09812         ; the Search-Order word set, so WORDLISTS is genuinely an unknown
                      (    forth6809.asm):09813         ; attribute here. Per ENVIRONMENT?'s own spec (6.1.1345): "If the
                      (    forth6809.asm):09814         ; system treats the attribute as unknown, the returned flag is
                      (    forth6809.asm):09815         ; false" - falling through to ENVNOTFOUND already produces exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):09816         ; that, correctly and completely, with no dispatcher work needed.
                      (    forth6809.asm):09817         ; Confirmed via MAME testing.
                      (    forth6809.asm):09818         ;
                      (    forth6809.asm):09819         ; MAX-D/MAX-UD were resolved this session via a genuine dispatcher
